@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
actor "Utilizador" as U
participant "App Expo\n(Sprint 2)" as App
participant "aircraft_detail()" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

U -> App : toca no ícone do avião
App -> API : GET /aircraft/{hex}
activate API
API -> DB : AIRCRAFT (hex)
DB --> API : identificação + foto
API -> DB : AIRCRAFT_LIVE (hex)
DB --> API : estado atual + rota
API --> App : 200 { ..., live: {...} }
deactivate API
App -> U : mostra painel
loop mensagens do /ws/live (US06)
  App -> App : procura hex em aircraft[]
  App -> U : atualiza altitude, velocidade, squawk
end
@enduml
